This repo is sage-prototypes. The MTD quiz prototype is ongoing_project/MTD/variant-a/index.html (generated by ongoing_project/MTD/build-variants.js from ongoing_project/MTD/mtd-income-tax/index.html; the quiz styles live in ongoing_project/MTD/mtd-income-tax/quiz-page.css and variant-quiz-figma.css, and the quiz itself runs inside an iframe). Serve the repo root with `python3 -m http.server 8150` and open /ongoing_project/MTD/variant-a/index.html to see it; Playwright is installed in node_modules if you want to check it in a browser.

Make these changes:
1. Make the MTD quiz full screen with normal page scroll instead of a modal box, so the bottom "Before continuing" banner (shown on question 2 when you answer "Yes, but I have not shared it with them yet") no longer clips at 1280x720 and 1024x540. There must be no inner scroll container.
2. Give the "Previous" link, and all links in the quiz, the original site's link states: default, hover, focus-visible and active. Follow the repo's link guideline.
3. Give the buttons and option cards the default, hover, pressed and focus states of the original site https://assets.dev-sageimagine.com/solution-finder/dist/accounting/en-CA/index.html . Set each state once, on the shared class, never per instance.

Keep the change minimal, do not touch unrelated files, and leave no debug code. Do not commit. When finished, reply with one short summary of what you changed.
